#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "General layout"
msgstr "Qaabka guud"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Displaying the interface from the bottom is better if you use a bottom panel instead of the default top bar."
msgstr "Muujinta interface-ka hoosta waa ka fiican tahay haddii aad isticmaasho guddi hoose halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd bar-sare ee caadiga ah."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From top to bottom"
msgstr "Kor ilaa hoos"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "From bottom to top"
msgstr "Hoos ilaa kor"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "The setting could not be saved"
msgstr "Dejinta lama keydin karo"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Number of emojis per line"
msgstr "Tirada emoji-yada xariiq kasta"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Size of emojis (px)"
msgstr "Cabbirka emoji-yada (px)"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Habaynta"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Modifier keys must be between chevrons"
msgstr "Furayaasha beddelka waa inay u dhexeeyaan calaamadaha < >"

#: src/prefs.ts
#, javascript-format
msgid "The default value is %s"
msgstr "Qiimaha caadiga ah waa %s"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Don't use a keyboard shortcut that already exists."
msgstr "Ha isticmaalin gaaban-kiiboodh hore u jira."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Use a keyboard shortcut to toggle the menu"
msgstr "Isticmaal gaaban-kiiboodh si aad menu-ga u furto ama u xidho"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Gaaban-kiiboodh"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This is not a valid keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Kani ma aha gaaban-kiiboodh sax ah"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "List of valid key names"
msgstr "Liiska magacyada furayaasha ee sax ah"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Always show the icon in the panel"
msgstr "Had iyo jeer ka muuji astaanta guddiga"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "If you access the menu with the keyboard shortcut, you don't need to always display the icon."
msgstr "Haddii aad menu-ga ku gasho gaaban-kiiboodhka, uma baahnid inaad had iyo jeer muujiso astaanta."

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "Keyboard bindings"
msgstr "Gaabanayaasha kiiboodhka"

#: src/prefs.ts src/lib/emojiMenu.ts
msgid "Emoji Selector"
msgstr "Emoji Selector"

#: src/prefs.ts
msgid "This extension provides a configurable popup menu displaying most emojis, clicking on an emoji copies it to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kordhintan waxay bixisaa menu la habeyn karo oo muujinaya inta badan emoji-yada; marka la gujiyo emoji waxaa lagu koobiyeeyaa clipboard-ka."

